#Material and option string usage key:

#A D S H R T I B Q P O F (C S) Xf

#A = ambient, 00–100 
#D = diffuse, 00–100 
#S = specular, 00–100 
#H = shine, 000–1000 
#R = reflective, 00–100 
#T = transparent, 00–100 
#I = refractive index, store (value - 1.0) * 100 → 000–400 
#B = bump level, 000–100 
#Q = object casts shadow, 0 or 1 
#P = bump enabled, 0 or 1 
#O = which option active(color, texture, checker)  0,1,2 
#F = frost 0 or 1 

#W = wave(planes only) 
#C = caps for cylinder and hyperboloid 
#S = single or double for the hyperboid/cone 0 0r 1 

#Xf = used to store base64 packed transform matrices(rottran and scale, others are derived from these at runtime).



